    <!-- Screen Pinning Explanation Screen -->
    <string name="explanation_title">Locking Device for Toddler</string>
    <string name="explanation_body">KidLoop keeps your toddler safely inside this playlist by locking navigation buttons and gestures using Android Screen Pinning.\n\n• When you tap Launch, Android will request permission to pin this screen.\n• Tap "Got it" or "OK" on the system prompt.\n• Touch taps on the screen are completely blocked.\n• Swipe Up goes to the next video, Swipe Down goes to the previous video.\n• To exit Kid Mode: Long-press the hidden top-right corner of the screen for 3 seconds.</string>
    <string name="explanation_warning_unpinned">Screen Pinning was not confirmed by the system. KidLoop will still shield touches, but for maximum toddler lock, please confirm Screen Pinning.</string>

